DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuhhccii driver provides support for UHCI-type PCI based USB controllers.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The uuhhccii driver supports all UHCI v1.1 compliant controllers including:

     ••   Intel 82371AB/EB (PIIX4)
     ••   Intel 82371SB (PIIX3)
     ••   VIA 83C572

